window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I never thought I'd move to New York.</p> <p>I certainly never expected to live in a mansion, rent free, with five super hot roommates.</p> <p>But none of those things surprised me as much as discovering the truth about my destiny, the revelation of the ancient power flowing through my veins and how it changes my life.</p> <p>I am the Raven Queen.</p> <p>Come meet my guardians.</p> <p>This is the complete Raven Queen's Harem, a reverse harem paranormal romance series all in ONE bundle! No wait! It's all here! Dive in today!</p> <p><i>Raven's Mark<br> </i></p> <p><i>Ebony Rising<br> </i></p> <p><i>Black Magic<br> </i></p> <p><i>Obsidian Fire<br> </i></p> <p><i>Onyx Eclipse<br> </i></p> <p><i>Midnight's End</i></p>"; 
